Z||000004||Songman||08-01-2001||12:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BENGAL4:<BR><B>My buddy lives in Hermitage and he is a Titans nut. Been to all of the Titans/Oilers vs Bengals games down there since they moved from Houston. Allways have a great time, but a long ride home. (We havent won a game down there yet)<P>Bill</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I moved out of the city about a year and a half ago and got me a little farm house out in the country with a couple of acres. I actually live in Hendersonville now. Used to live in Hermitage though.<P><B>Been to all of the Titans/Oilers vs Bengals games down there since they moved from Houston. Allways have a great time, but a long ride home. (We havent won a game down there yet)</B>[/QUOTE]<P>I haven't been to a game yet! Was only at the stadium once and that was for a George Strait show.<P>And no offense, but I do hope the Bengals carry on the tradition on this trip! heheh<P>Nothing like a little friendly rivalry between friends!<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
